the hands of trained Force-sensitive wielders.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Skullblades are considered items of great honor and importance. Although they can occasionally be found on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Black Market"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Black_Market"},", they are normally available only to those who train with ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Felucian Shamans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Felucian_Shamans","referenceId":"reference:3f5a6e0e902bd292"},". ",{"tag":"a","children":["Felucians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Felucians"}," treat the Felucian Skullblade as an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapon (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapon_(Melee)"}," instead of an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapon (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapon_(Melee)"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weapon Type:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Exotic Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Exotic_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:e0213365f7fdde76"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Size:"]}," Small\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,500\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," Setting:"]}," NO\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Type:"]}," Slashing\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
